eported revenues of €507 million in 2025, including €89 million in SaaS revenues. The Company is listed on Euronext, and is included in the CAC Small, CAC Mid \u0026 Small, CAC All-Tradable, CAC All Shares, CAC Technology, EN Tech Leaders et ENT PEA-PME 150 indices. ",{"type":"i","children":["For more information, visit "]},{"type":"i","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=GdsSvPB9kmkHvJK5s1gI6PszaFw8DLcmfRRFzZGMADQlZqyDRHXw5Unb9eeEUSML-Kdpp0AlNEJlya0pzy8IjQ==","linkText":"lectra.com"}}]},{"type":"i","children":["."]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Lectra – Registered address: 16–18, rue Chalgrin • 75016 Paris • France"]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel. +33 (0)1 53 64 42 00 – lectra.com"]},{"type":"p","children":["A French ",{"type":"i","children":["Société Anonyme"]}," with share capital of €38,063,263. RCS Paris 300 702 305"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Attachment"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=BBJKx4xI49TdPBQw73M0J_09iXRRMnavrpdpzvLskNk1oGVYhB2qbFHZDFhnKRNzXhMMOkc_4ibrHxeZ1e6Ssp8wHOWUeWaYlDNs2vM6uP9Hb0citlAv5V2j_acWVI1U6dxq9yib13_O7-g9OE2d1PRkr8kSE_8yAVvKWpRDkAEX27ZTcDTfDW3XDOeh3YLqnn--AO8tajRpbzCUmKm67zatGfVIx1yGkThbsbkAi_CmkaJcw_GNCHP4fKEFa8pFpO0u-cwFG_nmiZYLLNuTvuxxBe9Ttwa5wOmA1Crn67OQGAyoNC3WVVeFTqxYm6MR","linkText":"LECTRA: Share buyback program - Aggregated disclosure of transactions in own shares carried out from August 24 to August 28, 2026"}}]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"ETFs","args":[{"id":"category","value":"etf"}]},{"title":"French stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"FR"}]},{"title":"GlobeNewswire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"globenewswire"}]},{"title":"Indices","args":[{"id":"category","value":"index"}]},{"title":"Share buybacks","args":[{"id":"section","value":"share_buybacks"}]}],"robots":["noindex"],"id":"globenewswire:d653a1